{
  "id": "508",
  "title": "What Time is Convenient?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-05-02",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang calls the Great Wall Company to reschedule an appointment.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/726/ba2972cc29c727989644d7258374095480baac27.mp3?1698351312",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "您有没有方便的时间？\n\n小张：喂，长城公司的陈总吗？我是大华公司的小张。我们王总让我转告您，非常抱歉，她今天不能去贵公司和您会面了。她想知道，这周二的上午、周四的全天或周五的下午您有没有方便的时间？\n陈总：我看一下。周二上午怎么样？哦，还不行。那就周五下午吧。\n小张：行。您看几点合适？\n陈总：3点？\n小张：好的。那就周五下午3点。",
    "traditional": "您有沒有方便的時間？\n\n小張：喂，長城公司的陳總嗎？我是大華公司的小張。我們王總讓我轉告您，非常抱歉，她今天不能去貴公司和您會面了。她想知道，這週二的上午、週四的全天或週五的下午您有沒有方便的時間？\n陳總：我看一下。週二上午怎麼樣？哦，還不行。那就週五下午吧。\n小張：行。您看幾點合適？\n陳總：3點？\n小張：好的。那就週五下午3點。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What time is convenient to you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：喂，长城公司的陈总吗？",
      "traditional": "小張：喂，長城公司的陳總嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wéi cháng chéng gōng sī de chén zǒng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我是大华公司的小张。",
      "traditional": "我是大華公司的小張。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shì dà huá gōng sī de xiǎo zhāng",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Hello, is this the Great Wall Company's Manager Chen?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我们王总让我转告您，非常抱歉，",
      "traditional": "我們王總讓我轉告您，非常抱歉，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men wáng zǒng ràng wǒ zhuǎn gào nín fēi cháng bào qiàn",
      "english": "I'm Little Zhang from the Dahua Company."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "她今天不能去贵公司和您会面了。",
      "traditional": "她今天不能去貴公司和您會面了。",
      "pinyin": "tā jīn tiān bù néng qù guì gōng sī hé nín huì miàn le",
      "english": "Our Manager Wang asked me to let you know that she's sorry, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "她想知道，这周二的上午、周四的全天或周五的下午您有没有方便的时间？",
      "traditional": "她想知道，這週二的上午、週四的全天或週五的下午您有沒有方便的時間？",
      "pinyin": "tā xiǎng zhī dào zhè zhōu èr de shàng wǔ zhōu sì de quán tiān huò zhōu wǔ de xià wǔ nín yǒu méi yǒu fāng biàn de shí jiān",
      "english": ".. but she cannot make it to the meeting at your company today."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "She wants to know if you have time this week on Tuesday morning, any time on Thursday, or Friday afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "陈总：我看一下。周二上午怎么样？哦，还不行。那就周五下午吧。",
      "traditional": "陳總：我看一下。週二上午怎麼樣？哦，還不行。那就週五下午吧。",
      "pinyin": "chén zǒng wǒ kàn yí xià zhōu èr shàng wǔ zěn me yàng ò hái bù xíng nà jiù zhōu wǔ xià wǔ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Chen: I'll have a look. How about Tuesday morning? Ah, that's no good. Then Friday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：行。您看几点合适？",
      "traditional": "小張：行。您看幾點合適？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xíng nín kàn jǐ diǎn hé shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok. What time suits you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "陈总：3点？",
      "traditional": "陳總：3點？",
      "pinyin": "chén zǒng 1 diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Chen: 3 o'clock?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。那就周五下午3点。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。那就週五下午3點。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de nà jiù zhōu wǔ xià wǔ 1 diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok. Friday afternoon at 3 o'clock then."
    }
  ],
