    "sentence_translations": [
      "What time is convenient to you?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Hello, is this the Great Wall Company's Manager Chen?",
      "I'm Little Zhang from the Dahua Company.",
      "Our Manager Wang asked me to let you know that she's sorry, ..",
      ".. but she cannot make it to the meeting at your company today.",
      "She wants to know if you have time this week on Tuesday morning, any time on Thursday, or Friday afternoon?",
      "",
      "Manager Chen: I'll have a look. How about Tuesday morning? Ah, that's no good. Then Friday afternoon.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Ok. What time suits you?",
      "",
      "Manager Chen: 3 o'clock?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Ok. Friday afternoon at 3 o'clock then.",
      ""
